OL,3,AHow Dolly Parton helped the world -
OL,4,Afrom children's books to supporting
OL,5,ACovid vaccine
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolly Parton will not only be
OL,8,Fremembered for her iconic songs and
OL,9,FSouthern charm, but also for her
OL,10,Fphilanthropic work.
OL,12,FThroughout her life, she supported
OL,13,Fcommunities in need, especially in her
OL,14,Fhome state of Tennessee. She funded
OL,15,Fmedical research that led to one of the
OL,16,Ffirst Covid-19 vaccines, donated to
OL,17,Fwildfire victims and even helped the
OL,18,Fonce-endangered bald eagle, America's
OL,19,Fnational bird.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
