OL,3,AHow Dolly Parton helped the world -
OL,4,Afrom children's books to supporting
OL,5,ACovid vaccine
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut it is her Imagination Library - the
OL,8,Fmainstay of her charity work - that has
OL,9,Fhelped millions of children learn to
OL,10,Fread by sending out free books.
OL,12,FThe programme was inspired by her
OL,13,Ffather who couldn't read or write.
